OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA milder start, with rain,
OL,6,Fsometimes heavy and with blustery
OL,7,Fwinds. Rain clearing southeastwards
OL,8,Finto the afternoon allowing for some
OL,9,Fsunshine, but remaining breezy, and
OL,10,Fthe potential for the odd shower later
OL,11,Fin the north and west. Cooling down
OL,12,Ftoo.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FClear spells with light
OL,15,Fshowers around to start this evening.
OL,16,FShowers becoming more frequent into
OL,17,Fthe early hours of Saturday yet, with
OL,18,Fwinds easing. A chillier night than
OL,19,Fthe last.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
