OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FA mixed day with scattered
OL,6,Fshowers, but with plenty of sunshine
OL,7,Fin-between the showers too. Showers
OL,8,Fand winds easing during the evening.
OL,9,FFeeling cooler than on Friday.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FEarly
OL,12,Fbrightness, but rain arriving from the
OL,13,Fsouthwest on Sunday. Patchy light,
OL,14,Fdrizzly rain continuing into Monday,
OL,15,Fthen rain clearing to sunnier skies on
OL,16,FTuesday. Feeling milder with southerly
OL,17,Fwinds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
